msgstr "ID 的短名称：最多 20 个字符，仅限 [a-z0-9+_-]"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid "Affected package and version ranges (repeatable; required for security and release)"
msgstr "受影响的软件包和版本范围（可重复；对于安全和发布类型为必填项）"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid "Publication date, YYYY-MM-DD (default: today in UTC)"
msgstr "发布日期，YYYY-MM-DD（默认：UTC 时间的今天）"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid "Author, \"Name <email>\" (default: the configured git user)"
msgstr "作者，“姓名 <电子邮件>”（默认：已配置的 Git 用户）"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid "Read the body from this file instead of opening an editor"
msgstr "从该文件读取正文，而非打开编辑器"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid "Revise a published notice in both repositories"
msgstr "在两个仓库中修订已发布的通知"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid ""
"Open the notice's current text in $VISUAL / $EDITOR (or read it from\n"
"--body-file) and rewrite the news item and the site file together. The news\n"
"item's Revision goes up by one and the site file's updated becomes now;\n"
"the ID and the publication date stay."
msgstr ""
"在 $VISUAL / $EDITOR 中打开公告的当前文本（或从\n"
"--body-file）并同时重写新闻条目和站点文件。新闻\n"
"条目的 Revision 会加一，站点文件的 updated 会变为 now；\n"
"ID 和发布日期保持不变。"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid "New severity: info, warning or critical"
msgstr "新严重性级别：INFO、WARNING 或 CRITICAL"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid "New title, at most 50 characters"
msgstr "新标题，最多 50 个字符"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid "New one-line summary, at most 300 characters"
msgstr "新的单行摘要，最多 300 个字符"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid "Replace the affected packages (repeatable; same syntax as notice new)"
msgstr "替换受影响的软件包（可重复；语法与 notice new 相同）"

#: cmd/bentoo/notice.go
msgid "Take the new text from this file instead of opening an editor"
msgstr "从该文件获取新文本，而非打开编辑器"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_add.go
msgid "Add files to the staging area"
msgstr "将文件添加到暂存区"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_add.go
msgid ""
"Add files to the Git staging area in the overlay repository.\n"
"If no paths are specified, adds all changes (equivalent to \"git add .\")."
msgstr ""
"将文件添加到叠加仓库中的 Git 暂存区。\n"
"如果未指定路径，则添加所有更改（等同于“git add .”）。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_analyze.go
msgid "Analyze package and generate autoupdate schema"
msgstr "分析软件包并生成自动更新架构"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_analyze.go
msgid ""
"Analyze a package to determine the best way to check for upstream versions.\n"
"\n"
"The analyze command uses intelligent analysis to discover data sources and\n"
"generate update schemas automatically. It supports multiple data sources\n"
"including GitHub releases, PyPI, npm, crates.io, and HTML scraping.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo           Analyze single package\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo --url URL Override URL for analysis\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo --hint \"version is in header\"\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze --all                  Analyze all packages without schema\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo --no-cache  Bypass caches\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo --force   Overwrite existing schema\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo --dry-run Show schema without saving"
msgstr ""
"分析软件包，以确定检查上游版本的最佳方式。\n"
"\n"
"analyze 命令使用智能分析来发现数据源，并\n"
"自动生成更新架构。它支持多种数据源\n"
"包括 GitHub 版本、PyPI、npm、crates.io 和 HTML 抓取。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo           分析单个软件包\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo --url URL 用于分析的覆盖 URL\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo --hint \"version is in header\"\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze --all                  分析所有没有架构的软件包\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo --no-cache  绕过缓存\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo --force   覆盖现有架构\n"
"  bentoo overlay analyze net-misc/foo --dry-run 显示架构而不保存"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_analyze.go
msgid "Override URL for analysis"
msgstr "覆盖用于分析的 URL"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_analyze.go
msgid "Provide hint to LLM for guidance"
msgstr "向 LLM 提供提示以获得指导"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_analyze.go
msgid "Analyze all packages without schema"
msgstr "分析所有没有架构的包"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_analyze.go
msgid "Bypass all caches"
msgstr "绕过所有缓存"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_analyze.go
msgid "Overwrite existing schema"
msgstr "覆盖现有架构"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_analyze.go
msgid "Show schema without saving"
msgstr "显示架构而不保存"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Check and apply ebuild version updates"
msgstr "检查并应用 ebuild 版本更新"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid ""
"Automatically check upstream sources for new versions and apply updates.\n"
"\n"
"Distfiles (--apply, --revive and --clean, which all regenerate a Manifest):\n"
"\n"
"  --distdir            Directory pkgdev downloads into and digests from. It\n"
"                       defaults to the DISTDIR this machine's own package\n"
"                       manager reports (portageq distdir, itself normally\n"
"                       /var/cache/distfiles) — NOT to a temporary directory, so\n"
"                       a distfile fetched here is a distfile the next run and\n"
"                       the package manager both reuse. Set it in the config file\n"
"                       as autoupdate.distdir; this flag wins over that key.\n"
"  --distfiles-cache    Read-only cache consulted before downloading: a file\n"
"                       already there is symlinked into the working distdir\n"
"                       instead of fetched again. Nothing is ever written back\n"
"                       to it. Defaults to /var/cache/distfiles, and passing \"\"\n"
"                       disables the lookup. Set it in the config file as\n"
"                       autoupdate.distfiles_cache; this flag wins over that key.\n"
"\n"
"  The two default to the same directory, which makes the lookup a no-op — there\n"
"  is nothing to link when the cache IS the working distdir. They differ once you\n"
"  point --distdir somewhere else, and that is when the cache starts paying off.\n"
"\n"
"  Both names, and both meanings, are the ones `bentoo overlay manifest` already\n"
"  uses.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check              Check all packages for updates\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check net-misc/foo Check specific package\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --force      Check ignoring cache\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --no-fetch-cache  Check with one request per read, not one per URL\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --yes        Check, then write the registry pins without prompting\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --only source Check only source packages\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --only bin    Check only binary packages\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --list               List pending updates\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply net-misc/foo Apply update for package\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply all          Apply all pending updates\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply net-misc/foo --compile  Apply and compile test\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply net-misc/foo --clean    Apply and remove the old ebuild\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --revive-list         List orphaned packages with a newer upstream\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --revivable   Check active packages AND report revivable orphans\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --revive net-misc/foo Revive an orphan: seed from ::gentoo and bump\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --revive all          Revive every revivable orphan\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --repair net-misc/foo Repair a failed bump in its staged tree with claude\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --lint                Check packages.toml against the record model\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --lint --fix          Repair what the linter can, after showing the diff\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --lint --fix --yes    Repair unattended (this overlay auto-commits and pushes)\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --mark-auto-disabled --except dev-libs/icu-compat,media-libs/libjxl-compat\n"
"                                                  ONE-SHOT: unfreeze the entries the checker disabled before\n"
"                                                  disabled_by existed, sparing the two deliberate pins. Run it\n"
"                                                  once per registry; without --yes it prints the plan and stops\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply all --distdir /srv/distfiles   Download into a specific directory\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply all --distfiles-cache \"\"       Never reuse a cached distfile"
msgstr ""
"自动检查上游源是否有新版本，并应用更新。\n"
"\n"
"Distfiles（--apply、--revive 和 --clean，它们都会重新生成 Manifest）：\n"
"\n"
"  --distdir            pkgdev 下载到并从中生成摘要的目录。它\n"
"                       默认为此机器自己的包管理器所报告的 DISTDIR\n"
"                       管理器报告的 DISTDIR（portageq distdir，其本身通常为\n"
"                       /var/cache/distfiles）— 而不是临时目录，因此\n"
"                       此处获取的 distfile 是下次运行时以及\n"
"                       软件包管理器都会重复使用。在配置文件中将其设置为\n"
"                       作为 autoupdate.distdir；此标志的优先级高于该键。\n"
"  --distfiles-cache    下载前会先查询的只读缓存：如果文件\n"
"                       已经存在的文件会被符号链接到工作 distdir 中，\n"
"                       而不是再次获取。绝不会向其中写入任何内容\n"
"                       到其中。默认为 /var/cache/distfiles，传递 \"\"\n"
"                       将禁用查找。在配置文件中将其设置为\n"
"                       autoupdate.distfiles_cache；此标志的优先级高于该键。\n"
"\n"
"  这两个选项默认指向同一个目录，这使得查找成为一个空操作（no-op）——\n"
"  当缓存就是工作 distdir 时，就没有什么可链接的。一旦您\n"
"  将 --distdir 指向其他位置，这时缓存就开始发挥作用了。\n"
"\n"
"  这两个名称以及它们的含义，都是`bentoo overlay manifest`已经\n"
"  uses.\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check              检查所有软件包的更新\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check net-misc/foo 检查特定软件包\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --force      检查时忽略缓存\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --no-fetch-cache  每次读取只发出一个请求，而不是每个 URL 发出一个请求\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --yes        检查，然后不经提示写入注册表锁定\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --only source 仅检查源代码包\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --only bin    仅检查二进制软件包\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --list               列出待处理的更新\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply net-misc/foo 为软件包应用更新\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply all          应用所有待处理的更新\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply net-misc/foo --compile  应用并进行编译测试\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply net-misc/foo --clean    应用更新并移除旧的 ebuild\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --revive-list         列出具有更新上游版本的孤立软件包\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --check --revivable   检查活跃软件包，并报告可恢复的孤立软件包\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --revive net-misc/foo 恢复孤立包：从 ::gentoo 获取种子并升级版本\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --revive all          恢复所有可恢复的孤立包\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --repair net-misc/foo 使用 claude 修复其暂存树中失败的版本更新\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --lint                根据记录模型检查 packages.toml\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --lint --fix          显示差异后，修复 linter 能够修复的内容\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --lint --fix --yes    无人值守修复（此 overlay 会自动提交并推送）\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --mark-auto-disabled --except dev-libs/icu-compat,media-libs/libjxl-compat\n"
"                                                  一次性操作：解冻之前由检查器禁用的条目\n"
"                                                  存在 disabled_by，保留了两个有意设定的锁定。运行它\n"
"                                                  每个注册表运行一次；如果不加 --yes，它会打印计划并停止\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply all --distdir /srv/distfiles   下载到指定目录\n"
"  bentoo overlay autoupdate --apply all --distfiles-cache \"\"       绝不重复使用缓存的 distfile"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "检查更新"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "List pending updates"
msgstr "列出待处理的更新"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Apply update for specified package, or \"all\" for every pending update"
msgstr "对指定软件包应用更新，或对所有待处理更新使用 \"all\""

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Ignore cache when checking"
msgstr "检查时忽略缓存"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Removed: builds run only in --check --llm, unprivileged, up to --depth=install; kept so that typing it says what to run instead"
msgstr "已移除：构建仅在 --check --llm 下运行，无权限，最多到 --depth=install；保留此项是为了在键入时显示应运行的内容"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "With --apply: validate every bump to this rung of the ladder instead of the one its class and the config select — none, options, patches, configure, compile or install, each including every rung before it. This REPLACES classification, the package tier and configuration, in either direction, and it is the only input allowed to ask for less. Anything above \"options\" starts a build and therefore applies one package at a time"
msgstr "使用 --apply：验证每次升级到此梯级的操作，而不是其类别和配置选择的操作 — none、options、patches、configure、compile 或 install，每个操作都包括其前面的所有梯级。这会以任一方向替换分类、软件包层级和配置，并且是唯一允许要求更少的输入。任何高于“options”的选项都会启动构建，因此一次只应用一个软件包"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Cap how deep a bump is built: a package whose average build on this host (qlop) is above this duration, or which has no build history, is taken no further than configure. Overrides autoupdate.build.budget for this run; give the same budget to --apply, or set the key, so the apply asks for the depth the check proved"
msgstr "限制升级构建的深度：对于在此主机（qlop）上的平均构建时间超过此时长，或没有构建历史的软件包，其构建深度不会超过“configure”。覆盖本次运行的 autoupdate.build.budget；为 --apply 提供相同的预算，或者设置该键，以便 apply 请求检查已证明的深度。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Where the build gates of --check --llm, --revive and --repair run: host (the default), vm or container. Overrides autoupdate.build.backend for this run; a backend that is not available stops the run before any work, it never falls back to host"
msgstr "--check --llm、--revive 和 --repair 的构建门禁运行位置：host（默认值）、vm 或 container。针对此运行覆盖 autoupdate.build.backend；如果后端不可用，则在任何工作开始之前停止运行，且绝不会回退到主机。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "SKIP the compile gate rather than run it without a verified network namespace. Without this an unisolated compile still runs, and its pass is labelled \"unverified isolation\" — creating the namespace needs privilege an ordinary user does not have, and Portage reports network-sandbox in FEATURES either way"
msgstr "SKIP 编译门，而不是在没有经过验证的网络命名空间的情况下运行它。如果没有此选项，未隔离的编译仍会运行，其通过结果将被标记为“未经验证的隔离” — 创建命名空间需要普通用户不具备的权限，无论哪种情况，Portage 都会在 FEATURES 中报告 network-sandbox。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "With --apply: sweep that package's directory after a successful apply. WITHOUT --apply: sweep the whole overlay — every package directory holding an ebuild no registry entry claims — optionally narrowed by a positional <category> or <category/package>. The full plan is printed BEFORE the confirmation, and the ebuilds are DELETED from an overlay that auto-commits and pushes, which is why an unattended sweep requires --yes. A directory whose entry has no version pin, or that no entry claims, is reported and left alone"
msgstr "使用 --apply：在成功应用后，清理该软件包的目录。不使用 --apply：清理整个 overlay — 每个包含 ebuild 但没有注册表条目声明的软件包目录 — 可选通过位置参数 <category> 或 <category/package> 缩小范围。完整计划会在确认之前打印出来，ebuild 会从自动提交和推送的 overlay 中被删除，这就是为什么无人值守的清理需要 --yes 的原因。对于条目没有版本锁定或没有条目声明的目录，将报告该目录并不做任何处理。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "max parallel checks/applies (1-100). A standalone --clean sweep does NOT take this default: it runs one directory at a time unless the flag is passed explicitly, because whether concurrent pkgdev manifest runs contend on DISTDIR or on pkgdev's own locking was never measured"
msgstr "最大并行检查/应用数（1-100）。独立的 --clean 清理不会采用此默认值：除非显式传递该标志，否则它一次只处理一个目录，因为从未测量过并发的 pkgdev 清单运行是在 DISTDIR 上竞争还是在 pkgdev 自身的锁定上竞争。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "per-request HTTP timeout in seconds for --check, --revive and the vendor-tarball probe of --apply (0 = use config autoupdate.http_timeout, default 30)"
msgstr "--check、--revive 以及 --apply 的供应商源代码包探测的每次请求 HTTP 超时（以秒为单位）（0 = 使用配置 autoupdate.http_timeout，默认为 30）"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Restrict --check to packages of this type: \"bin\" or \"source\""
msgstr "将 --check 限制为以下类型的软件包：“bin”或“source”"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "List disabled (orphaned) packages whose upstream is newer than ::gentoo"
msgstr "列出上游版本比 ::gentoo 更新的已禁用（孤立）软件包"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "With --apply or --revive: promote these packages (cat/pkg or record key, comma-separated or repeated) without a cooldown entry, for a security fix that must not wait. Each skip is logged and listed in the Cooldown summary"
msgstr "使用 --apply 或 --revive 时：对于绝不能等待的安全修复，在没有冷却期条目的情况下提升这些软件包（cat/pkg 或记录键，以逗号分隔或重复）。每次跳过都会被记录，并列在“冷却”摘要中"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "With --apply or --revive: switch the overlay's cooldown ON before anything is promoted, so every promoted version is masked for this many days (bare --cooldown = 7, range 1-3650) while the previous version stays installable. It writes the managed bentoo-cooldown block into the overlay's profiles/package.mask — PUBLISHED, so the mask reaches every host that syncs the overlay — and it is persistent: later runs mask without the flag. On an overlay already under cooldown it rewrites days= only"
msgstr "使用 --apply 或 --revive 时：在任何内容升级之前，先将 overlay 的冷却功能切换为 ON，这样每个升级的版本都会被屏蔽指定天数（仅 --cooldown = 7，范围为 1-3650），而旧版本仍可安装。它将托管的 bentoo-cooldown 块写入 overlay 的 profiles/package.mask — PUBLISHED，因此掩码会传播到同步该 overlay 的每台主机 — 并且它是持久的：之后的运行会在不使用该标志的情况下应用掩码。对于已处于冷却期的 overlay，它仅重写 days="

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Revive an orphaned package by seeding from ::gentoo and bumping it, or \"all\" for every revivable orphan"
msgstr "通过从 ::gentoo 种子并对其进行版本提升来恢复孤立软件包，或者使用“all”来恢复所有可恢复的孤立软件包"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Repair a failed bump interactively: show the repair bundle a failed apply left beside its kept staged tree, start a claude session there on confirmation, asking before every command, then re-validate the staged tree and promote it as --apply would. Needs a terminal on stdin and stdout and the claude executable on PATH"
msgstr "以交互方式修复失败的升级：显示因应用失败而留在其保留的暂存树旁边的修复捆绑包；经确认后，在那里启动一个 claude 会话，在执行每个命令前都进行询问；然后重新验证暂存树，并像 --apply 那样将其升级。需要在 stdin 和 stdout 上有一个终端，并且 PATH 上有 claude 可执行文件"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "With --check, also report revivable orphans (disabled+absent, upstream newer than ::gentoo) in the same pass"
msgstr "使用 --check 时，还会在同一轮次中报告可恢复的孤立包（已禁用+不存在，上游版本比 ::gentoo 更新）"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "DEPRECATED, use --ui=plain instead. It is still honoured and its behaviour has not changed: it disables the live TUI and streams plain output, it is exactly --ui=plain, and it OUTRANKS both --ui and BENTOO_UI — so --no-tui --ui=fullscreen renders plain, because an opt-out a flag could override would not be an opt-out. The two environment variables it has always answered to, NO_COLOR and BENTOO_NO_TUI, are unchanged and mean the same thing as passing it"
msgstr "已弃用，请改用 --ui=plain。它仍然有效，其行为也未发生变化：它会禁用实时TUI并以纯文本形式输出，它与 --ui=plain 完全等同，并且其优先级高于 --ui 和 BENTOO_UI — 因此 --no-tui --ui=fullscreen 会以纯文本形式渲染，因为如果一个可被标志覆盖的选择性禁用就不算真正的禁用。它始终响应的两个环境变量 NO_COLOR 和 BENTOO_NO_TUI 保持不变，其含义与传递该选项相同。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Check packages.toml against the record model: layout (# END marker, comments field last, no floating comments), field set (unknown or retired keys, redundant enabled = true, canonical field order) and semantics (invalid or ambiguous entries, undeclared release lines, commit tracking with no base source)"
msgstr "对照记录模型检查 packages.toml：布局（# END 标记、comments 字段在最后、无浮动注释）、字段集（未知或已弃用的键、冗余的 enabled = true、规范字段顺序）和语义（无效或模糊的条目、未声明的发布行、无基准源代码的提交跟踪）"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "With --lint: repair in place the violations that have a mechanical fix (the retired binary key, a redundant enabled = true, the canonical field order). The unified diff is printed BEFORE the confirmation, and packages.toml is PUBLISHED — this overlay auto-commits and pushes, so the write reaches origin — which is why an unattended repair requires --yes. Findings no repair can guess (an entry tracking commits with no base source) are reported and left to a human"
msgstr "使用 --lint：就地修复存在机械性修复方法的违规（已弃用的二进制键、冗余的 enabled = true、规范的字段顺序）。统一的差异会在确认之前打印出来，并且 packages.toml 会被 PUBLISHED（发布）——此 overlay 会自动提交和推送，因此写入会到达源仓库——这就是为什么无人值守的修复需要 --yes 的原因。对于无法通过修复推测的问题（例如跟踪提交但没有基准源代码的条目），系统会报告这些问题并交由人工处理。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "ONE-SHOT MIGRATION: stamp disabled_by = \"auto\" on every entry the checker disabled before that key existed, so the reconciliation is free to re-enable them when their ebuild returns. Without it those entries state no origin, which now reads as a deliberate decision and freezes them for good. An entry that is held, already stamped, still enabled, or named in --except is left alone, and a second run changes nothing. The full plan is printed BEFORE the confirmation, and packages.toml is PUBLISHED — this overlay auto-commits and pushes, so the write reaches origin — which is why an unattended migration requires --yes"
msgstr "一次性迁移：对检查器在该键存在之前禁用的每个条目，都标记 disabled_by = \"auto\"，这样在它们的 ebuild 返回时，协调过程就可以自由地重新启用它们。如果没有此操作，这些条目将不显示来源，这现在被视为一项刻意决定，并将它们永久冻结。对于被保留、已加盖标记、仍处于启用状态或在 --except 中指定的条目，将不做任何处理，第二次运行也不会有任何变化。完整计划会在确认之前打印出来，并且 packages.toml 会被 PUBLISHED — 此 overlay 会自动提交并推送，因此写入会到达 origin — 这就是为什么无人值守的迁移需要 --yes 的原因。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "With --mark-auto-disabled: the entries the migration must NOT stamp, comma-separated or repeated. These are the pins a maintainer disabled ON PURPOSE — for this overlay, dev-libs/icu-compat and media-libs/libjxl-compat — and stamping one hands it back to the reconciliation that re-enabled and bumped it before. An entry naming no record in packages.toml ABORTS the run: a typo protects nothing and would otherwise pass in silence"
msgstr "使用 --mark-auto-disabled：迁移过程绝不能加盖戳记的条目，以逗号分隔或重复列出。这些是维护者故意禁用的锁定——对于此 overlay，是 dev-libs/icu-compat 和 media-libs/libjxl-compat ——而对其中一个进行标记会将其交还给之前重新启用并提升过它的协调过程。如果条目指定的名称在 packages.toml 中没有对应的记录，则会中止运行：拼写错误无法提供任何保护，否则将悄然通过。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Approve without prompting whatever this run would otherwise stop and ask about: the post-check registry reconciliation, a --lint --fix repair, a --mark-auto-disabled migration, and a standalone --clean sweep. REQUIRED for any non-interactive write — without it, a piped or scripted run prints what it would do and changes nothing. Note the reach: with --clean this DELETES ebuilds, and with --fix or --mark-auto-disabled it rewrites packages.toml, in an overlay that auto-commits and pushes"
msgstr "对于本次运行中本应停止并询问的所有事项，一律不经提示直接批准：检查后注册表协调、--lint --fix 修复、--mark-auto-disabled 迁移以及独立的 --clean 清理。对于任何非交互式写入，此选项是必需的 — 如果没有此选项，通过管道或脚本运行的命令将仅打印其将要执行的操作，而不会进行任何更改。请注意影响范围：使用 --clean 时，这会删除 ebuild；使用 --fix 或 --mark-auto-disabled 时，这会在自动提交并推送的 overlay 中重写 packages.toml。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Distfiles directory used by pkgdev (default: the host's own DISTDIR, as reported by portageq distdir; overrides the autoupdate.distdir config key)"
msgstr "pkgdev 使用的 Distfiles 目录（默认值：主机自己的 DISTDIR，由 portageq distdir 报告；覆盖 autoupdate.distdir 配置项）"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Read-only distfiles cache consulted before download (\"\" disables; overrides the autoupdate.distfiles_cache config key)"
msgstr "下载前会先查询只读的 distfiles 缓存（“ ”表示禁用；会覆盖 autoupdate.distfiles_cache 配置项）"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "Fetch each URL per record instead of sharing one response across records that declare it"
msgstr "为每个记录单独获取其URL，而不是在声明该URL的多个记录之间共享同一个响应"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_autoupdate.go
msgid "With --check: prove each pending bump in a staged tree — without it --check only reads versions. With --check or --revive: let the configured claude-code agent take part in validation. --apply only publishes what a check proved and refuses this flag. It enables BOTH agent capabilities — the bump reviewer, which reads what changed between the two versions and may ask for MORE validation than the depth policy chose, and the build fixer, which repairs the STAGED ebuild after a failed build and re-runs the same gate to decide. Set autoupdate.validate.review or fix_on_failure to false to switch one of them back off; neither key enables anything without this flag. Requires the claude CLI on PATH and provider = \"claude-code\" — otherwise the run warns once and the gates run without the agent"
msgstr "使用 --check：在暂存树中验证每个待处理的升级 — 不使用此选项时，--check 仅读取版本。使用 --check 或 --revive：让已配置的 claude-code 代理参与验证。--apply 仅发布经检查验证的内容，并拒绝此标志。它启用了两种代理功能：一是版本更新审核器，它会读取两个版本之间的变化，并可能要求比深度策略所选的验证级别更高的验证；二是构建修复器，它会在构建失败后修复STAGED ebuild，然后重新运行相同的关卡以做出决定。将 autoupdate.validate.review 或 fix_on_failure 设置为 false 以将其中一个功能重新禁用；如果没有此标志，这两个键都不会启用任何功能。需要 PATH 中有 claude CLI 且 provider = \"claude-code\" — 否则运行会警告一次，且关卡将在没有代理的情况下运行"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_commit.go
msgid "Commit staged changes with auto-generated message"
msgstr "使用自动生成的提交信息提交已暂存的更改"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_commit.go
msgid ""
"Commit staged changes to the overlay repository.\n"
"If no message is provided with -m, an automatic commit message is generated\n"
"based on the ebuild changes and a confirmation prompt is shown.\n"
"Use -y to skip the confirmation prompt and commit automatically."
msgstr ""
"将已暂存的更改提交到 overlay 仓库。\n"
"如果未通过 -m 提供消息，则会生成一条自动提交消息\n"
"基于 ebuild 更改，并显示确认提示。\n"
"使用 -y 跳过确认提示并自动提交。"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_commit.go
msgid "Custom commit message (bypasses auto-generation)"
msgstr "自定义提交消息（绕过自动生成）"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_commit.go
msgid "Show what would be committed without committing"
msgstr "显示将要提交的内容，但不实际提交"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_commit.go
msgid "Skip confirmation prompt and commit automatically"
msgstr "跳过确认提示并自动提交"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_compare.go
msgid "Compare overlay packages with upstream repository"
msgstr "将 Overlay 包与上游仓库进行比较"

#: cmd/bentoo/overlay_compare.go
msgid ""
"Compare package versions in your local Bentoo overlay against\n"
"an upstream repository.\n"
"\n"
"Any repository from the Gentoo ecosystem (~428 repos) can be used by name.\n"
"The repository list is fetched from the official Gentoo repositories.xml\n"
"registry and cached locally. Use --sync to force a refresh.\n"
"\n"
"Custom repositories can also be defined in ~/.config/bentoo/config.yaml\n"
"and take priority over registry entries.\n"
"\n"
"The provider (GitHub API, GitLab API, or Git) is automatically detected\n"
"based on the repository's source URL. Use --clone to force git clone.\n"
"\n"
"By default, all packages are shown (outdated, up-to-date, and newer).\n"
"Use --only-outdated to filter and show only packages that need updates.\n"
"Use --only-redundant to see just the removal candidates, or --only-patched\n"
"to see just the packages an .autoupdate/packages.toml entry declares a\n"
"divergence for. The three filters combine by intersection.\n"
"\n"
"Where a package differs from upstream and nothing declares why, a local model\n"
"(the claude CLI, on your own subscription) reads both ebuilds and says what the\n"
"difference does and which side it came from. It is commentary: the verdicts and\n"
"the removal recommendations are the same with or without it, nothing it says is\n"
"written to a file, and --no-review contacts no model at all.\n"
"\n"
"Use --realign to measure every package against the ::gentoo ebuild it should be\n"
"compared with: which baseline was used and how far it is, which structural axes\n"
"differ, what the ebuild declares about them, and what a model makes of what is\n"
"left. It needs ::gentoo's tree on this machine, so it is refused against any\n"
"other repository and against an API-only provider. Without it the command behaves\n"
"exactly as it always has.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare                    # Compare with gentoo (API)\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare guru               # Compare with GURU (API)\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare some-overlay       # Compare with any registered repo\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --clone            # Compare with gentoo (git clone)\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --sync             # Refresh repo list before comparing\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --only-outdated    # Show only outdated packages\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --only-redundant   # Show only removal candidates\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --only-patched     # Show only declared divergences\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --no-review        # Contact no model\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --realign          # Review against the ::gentoo baseline"
msgstr ""
"将您本地 Bentoo Overlay 中的软件包版本与以下内容进行比较：\n"
"一个上游仓库。\n"
"\n"
"Gentoo 生态系统中的任何仓库（约 428 个仓库）都可以按名称使用。\n"
"仓库列表是从官方 Gentoo repositories.xml 注册表获取的，\n"
"注册表并本地缓存。使用 --sync 强制刷新。\n"
"\n"
"还可以在 ~/.config/bentoo/config.yaml 中定义自定义仓库\n"
"并且优先于注册表条目。\n"
"\n"
"提供商（GitHub API、GitLab API 或 Git）会自动检测\n"
"基于仓库的源 URL。使用 --clone 强制执行 git clone。\n"
"\n"
"默认情况下，会显示所有软件包（过时、最新和更新版本）。\n"
"使用 --only-outdated 来筛选并仅显示需要更新的软件包。\n"
"使用 --only-redundant 仅查看待移除的候选包，或使用 --only-patched\n"
"以仅查看 .autoupdate/packages.toml 条目声明存在\n"
"差异的包。这三个筛选条件通过交集进行组合。\n"
"\n"
"当某个软件包与上游存在差异，且没有任何内容说明原因时，本地模型\n"
"（claude CLI，使用您自己的订阅）会读取两个 ebuild，并说明\n"
"差异的作用以及差异来自哪一方。这只是说明性文字：裁定结果和\n"
"无论有无此功能，删除建议都是一样的，它所说的任何内容都不会\n"
"写入文件，并且 --no-review 完全不会联系任何模型。\n"
"\n"
"使用 --realign 将每个软件包与它应与之比较的 ::gentoo ebuild 进行比较：\n"
"比较：使用了哪条基线以及相距多远，哪些结构轴\n"
"有所不同，ebuild 对它们做了哪些声明，以及模型对剩余部分做了哪些处理\n"
"剩余部分。它需要这台机器上的 ::gentoo 树，因此对于任何其他\n"
"其他仓库以及仅提供 API 的提供商。如果没有它，该命令的行为将\n"
"与以往完全一样。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare                    # 与 Gentoo 进行比较（API）\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare guru               # 与 GURU（API）进行比较\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare some-overlay # 与任何已注册的仓库进行比较\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --clone            # 与 gentoo 进行比较（git clone）\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --sync             # 在比较之前刷新仓库列表\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --only-outdated    # 仅显示过时的软件包\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --only-redundant   # 仅显示待移除候选项\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --only-patched     # 仅显示已声明的差异\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --no-review        # 不使用模型进行联系\n"
"  bentoo overlay compare --realign          # 对照 ::gentoo 基线进行审核"

